            "Apple said it will \"introduce additional controls to ensure that users who genuinely wish to grant an app this extraordinary level of access can only do so with very explicit user action\", and gave its reason directly: \"Addressing this is critical. As AI agents become increasingly capable and autonomous, the risks associated with this level of access will grow substantially.\"",
