            "Affected versions run from 18.1.6 up to (but not including) 19.2.4, from 19.3 before 19.3.2 and from 19.4 before 19.4.1; the fixes are 19.2.4, 19.3.2 and 19.4.1, and no fixed version exists below 19.2.4. GitLab's own hosted gateways were already patched, so only self-managed customers must act.",
